"""The mutants of K9R (the read program of the delegated daily phases). Each row: (name, target, exact anchor,
replacement). The anchor must occur exactly once in every file the target is applied to (mutate.py check). Target
'op' is the operation's own part as it stands in build/k9_phase_read.py.
One mutant per refusal of validate_plan and of the window, per member of effects_of(), per finding and decision of
each mode, per check of the probe's line, per contract check of the files RESULT reads, and the words of the probe's
prefix and of the pinned snippet that decide what it does."""
M=[]
def add(name,target,old,new):M.append((name,target,old,new))
def op(name,old,new):add(name,'op',old,new)

